abstract: >-
  Mid-term research repository for a speaker-conditioned BSRNN target speech
  extraction system. The model combines a frozen ECAPA-TDNN speaker encoder
  with an eight-layer band-split RNN trained on LibriSpeech and DEMAND
  mixtures. The repository contains the research notebooks, report source,
  compiled report, and a training/evaluation code skeleton.
